  <p class="foot">
    <b>Indicative only.</b> These figures are built on the assumptions shown, including aggregated industry data. They are not a forecast, a guarantee of return, or an offer of finance. Actual results depend on rentals achieved, utilisation, rider retention, running costs and market conditions, and may be materially different. Nothing here is financial, tax or legal advice. Estimates only, not a quote or an offer of finance. Petrol cost per kilometre is derived from the pump price you enter and a fixed 24 km per litre, typical for a loaded delivery bike in stop-start traffic. Kilometres shown are average market figures for a delivery rider and will differ by route and operator. Excludes maintenance, insurance and tracking. All figures exclude VAT.
